    "question": "A healthcare analytics company in AWS Organizations is preparing to share specific S3 buckets, KMS keys, and SQS queues with a new partner account. Before any sharing begins, the compliance team must produce evidence of every resource in the organization that is already accessible from outside the organization, and after the launch it must be alerted whenever a policy change makes a resource externally reachable beyond the approved partner grants. Which solution meets these requirements?",
