        "text": "Keep the bucket policy minimal and grant each team prefix-level access by applying object ACLs that name the team's canonical account ID as grantee.",
        "correct": false,
        "explanation": "ACLs are applied per object rather than per prefix, cannot express prefix-scoped conditions, and are a legacy mechanism AWS recommends disabling rather than expanding."
