    "question": "After a suspected insider incident, the security team at a healthcare company must begin capturing every GetObject call against one S3 bucket that holds 2 TB of patient exports. Investigators need the assumed-role session name, source IP address, and request parameters for each read, records must be complete rather than best-effort, and events must be queryable within about 15 minutes of the access. The team has approved the per-request charges for this single bucket. Which solution meets these requirements?",
