        "text": "Run an S3 Batch Operations job from the same inventory manifest that replaces the ACL on the legacy public-read objects with a private ACL.",
        "correct": true,
        "explanation": "The Batch Operations replace-ACL action strips the public-read grants across millions of objects from the same manifest-driven workflow, completing the second remediation goal."
