        "text": "Enable Amazon Macie automated sensitive data discovery on the account so that anomalous object downloads from the sensitive bucket are surfaced as findings.",
        "correct": false,
        "explanation": "Macie identifies and classifies sensitive data at rest; it does not model access-behavior anomalies such as unusual bulk downloads, so it would not have caught the red team's activity."
