    "question": "A financial analytics company runs an Amazon OpenSearch Service domain with a public endpoint. The domain access policy allows the office's IP range, but the range changes whenever the ISP renews its lease, which breaks analyst access until the policy is updated. Compliance has now ruled that the domain must be unreachable from the internet and that each analyst must be able to read only the indexes belonging to their own business unit. Which solution meets these requirements?",
