        "text": "Accept the default aws/dms AWS managed key for the replication instance and record its key ARN in the compliance report.",
        "correct": false,
        "explanation": "The aws/dms key is created and managed by AWS, so it does not satisfy the requirement for a key the company itself created and controls."
