        "text": "Perform the restore in place onto the existing table so its ARN, IAM policies, and integrations continue working unchanged.",
        "correct": false,
        "explanation": "DynamoDB does not support in-place restores; both PITR and on-demand backups can only create a new table, never overwrite an existing one."
