        "text": "Lower the task's TimeoutSeconds so that throttled API calls fail quickly and the workflow can move on to its next state without waiting on slow responses.",
        "correct": false,
        "explanation": "Shorter timeouts convert throttled calls into timeout errors faster but do not retry them or route them anywhere useful, so executions would still fail without a Catch and fallback in place."
