        "id": "f",
        "text": "Add a Catch on the task that routes exhausted-retry errors to a fallback state that applies the default tax estimate and flags the order for manual review.",
        "correct": true,
        "explanation": "A Catch clause fires only after the Retry policy is exhausted, so persistent unavailability degrades gracefully into the required default-estimate path instead of failing the execution."
