    "question": "A SaaS provider has signed a contract requiring that every customer document uploaded to its bucket in eu-west-1 be present in eu-central-1 within 15 minutes, backed by a measurable service commitment. The provider must also produce per-object evidence of replication timeliness and alert its operations team whenever any object exceeds the threshold. Which solution will meet these requirements?",
