    "question": "A law firm must back up 30 TB of case files from an on-premises NFS-attached NAS to Amazon S3 every night. Its records-compliance policy requires cryptographic proof that each transferred file in Amazon S3 matches the on-premises source, with results the firm can show auditors, and the IT team of three wants to avoid building or maintaining custom transfer code. Which solution will meet these requirements?",
