        "text": "Attach an Elastic Fabric Adapter to the instance so the node gains access to the higher network bandwidth tiers of the instance type.",
        "correct": false,
        "explanation": "EFA adds an OS-bypass interface for tightly coupled HPC and ML communication patterns; it is not required for high-throughput VPC traffic and does not raise the instance's rated bandwidth."
