        "text": "Select a current-generation instance size rated above 12 Gbps and verify the AMI includes the ENA driver with enaSupport enabled.",
        "correct": true,
        "explanation": "Sustaining more than 10 Gbps requires both an instance size whose network specification meets the target and an AMI that ships the ENA driver with enhanced networking enabled."
