        "id": "d",
        "text": "Deploy edge-optimized API Gateway endpoints in front of the APIs in both Regions so requests enter the AWS network at the closest point of presence to each client.",
        "correct": false,
        "explanation": "Edge-optimized endpoints ride CloudFront's distribution addresses, which are not fixed, and the two regional APIs would still fail over through DNS-based routing."
