        "text": "The minimum TTL of 0 seconds forces CloudFront to revalidate every request with the origin, so the team should raise the minimum TTL.",
        "correct": false,
        "explanation": "A minimum TTL of 0 only permits the origin to declare short lifetimes; it does not force revalidation when the origin explicitly allows 24 hours of caching."
