    "correctOptionIds": [
      "b"
    ],
    "sourceCorrectOptionIds": [
      "b"
    ],
    "answerSummary": "Enable Gzip and Brotli support in the custom cache policy so edge compression can take effect.",
    "explanation": "The Compress objects automatically setting works only when the attached cache policy also enables Gzip and Brotli support, which normalizes Accept-Encoding into the cache key and lets CloudFront store compressed variants. The custom policy was created without those flags, so compression silently never happens even though the viewers and content are eligible.",
