        "text": "Deploy a CloudFront Function on the viewer request event that reads the CloudFront-Viewer-Country header and returns a redirect to the matching storefront path.",
        "correct": true,
        "explanation": "CloudFront Functions run at every edge location for a fraction of Lambda@Edge cost, and the AWS-provided viewer-country header supplies geolocation with nothing for the retailer to maintain."
