    "question": "A photo-sharing service fronts its web tier with a CloudFront distribution that has nine cache behaviors, and the overall cache hit ratio has drifted down to 55%. One team is proposing Origin Shield and a larger origin fleet, but the lead architect wants evidence showing exactly which paths and behaviors are generating the misses before any re-architecture is approved. The distribution currently has no logging enabled. Which combination of steps will identify the low-performing behaviors? (Choose three.)",
