        "text": "Enable EventBridge notifications on the bucket, with rules matching key prefix and object size routing events to every target, plus an event archive for replay.",
        "correct": true,
        "explanation": "EventBridge receives S3 events with rich payload fields including object size, supports content-based rules routing one event to many targets such as Lambda, Step Functions, and SQS, and its archive feature enables replaying past events into a pipeline."
